      "source_text": "呵呵，你在这个国家，\n找到了理解你，\n并愿意与你切磋琢磨的伙伴呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a6e99e1483a49eecd1f3dbc63aa17c274a3b08a0e5035abb0d8149c69df0bbe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
