      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“──获得年度代表赛马娘的\n吉兆小姐！\n不管是在国内还是国外，其关注度都日渐高涨！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "f764f90ebc45f3174335d77cb5809a1fabb819d87a3c795bc1d8bc09e66e8a4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
