    {
      "uid": "zhcn:660ca734015be885ca5490bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“尤其她去年在有马纪念上压倒性的精彩表现，\n令许多人留下深刻印象──\n今天我们也采访了民众对她的看法！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb6e1087f0a755e909afa816cc566de5cab99eaca6220afb91c8a25d67da51dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
